OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy and
OL,6,Ffrequent squally showers during this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight, the risk of the
OL,8,Fodd rumble of thunder in the west.
OL,9,FOccasional drier spells in the east.
OL,10,FWindy with coastal gales in northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRemaining windy and showery,
OL,13,Fthe showers heavy with the risk of the
OL,14,Fodd thunderstorm. A few drier and
OL,15,Fbright spells in the east. Windy, with
OL,16,Fcoastal gales in far northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
