OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith occasional showers and easing
OL,7,Fwinds on Saturday. Windy with further
OL,8,Fshowers, perhaps some longer spells of
OL,9,Frain, on Sunday. Bright start Monday
OL,10,Fthen increasingly heavy showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
